        "raw": "<p>I know Foote&#39;s done some Pilot Operations Manual posts in the GSF Rules sub-forum - are they more detailed than what you&#39;re looking for?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 8008,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
